sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Staff
    participant IS as InventoryService
    participant SI as StockItem (BLR/LAP-001)
    participant AL as AuditLog
    participant EP as StockEventPublisher
    participant DA as DashboardAlertListener
    participant RS as ReplenishmentService
    participant ST as ReplenishmentStrategy

    S->>IS: ship(staff, BLR, LAP-001, 6, ORD-2)
    IS->>IS: staff.require(SHIP_STOCK)
    IS->>SI: remove(6)
    activate SI
    Note over SI: lock()<br/>check 15 >= 6<br/>quantity = 9<br/>snapshot StockChange(15 -> 9, level 10)<br/>unlock()
    SI-->>IS: StockChange
    deactivate SI
    IS->>AL: append(SHIP, -6, 15 -> 9, staff, ORD-2)
    Note over IS: lock already released
    IS->>EP: publish(LOW_STOCK)  [crossedIntoLowStock = true]
    EP->>DA: onEvent -> WARNING alert
    EP->>RS: onEvent(LOW_STOCK)
    RS->>RS: re-check isLow(), no open PO for BLR/LAP-001
    RS->>ST: reorderQuantity(item)  [category -> strategy]
    ST-->>RS: 50
    RS->>RS: openByItem.putIfAbsent(BLR/LAP-001, PO-1)
    IS-->>S: 9

    Note over S,ST: later: supplier delivers
    S->>RS: receive(staff, PO-1)
    RS->>RS: openById.remove(PO-1)  (a PO is received only once)
    RS->>IS: receive(staff, BLR, LAP-001, 50, PO-1)
    IS->>SI: add(50)  (9 -> 59)
    RS->>RS: openByItem.remove(...), replenish again if still low
